utation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[18,12,46,32,10,21],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[18,12,46,32,10,21],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[18,12,46,32,10,21],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[18,12,46,32,10,21],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"97","reputation":"2750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10160","city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[18,12,46,32,10,21],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"97","reputation":"2750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007802","armor":"WP1015505","helmet":"WP1026905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"张鲁麾下谋士，及其贪爱金银财宝。因受到刘备谋士孙乾的贿赂，而捏造谣言，使马超与张鲁不欢而散，投奔刘备。曹操攻入汉中时，杨松与庞德共同守城，却因收了曹军贿赂而针对庞德，导致庞德投靠了曹操。最后因卖主求荣，遭曹操鄙夷而被处刑。","tc":"張魯麾下謀士，及其貪愛金銀財寶。因受到劉備謀士孫乾的賄賂，而捏造謠言，使馬超與張魯不歡而散，投奔劉備。曹操攻入漢中時，楊松與龐德共同守城，卻因收了曹軍賄賂而針對龐德，導致龐德投靠了曹操。最后因賣主求榮，遭曹操鄙夷而被處刑。","en":"Adviser to Zhang Lu, notorious for his insatiable greed for gold and silver. After being bribed by Liu Bei's envoy Sun Qian, he fabricated rumors that drove a wedge between Ma Chao and Zhang Lu, causing Ma Chao to defect to Liu Bei. When Cao Cao invaded Hanzhong, Yang Song co-defended the city with Pang De but, having accepted bribes from the Cao army, undermined Pang De at every turn, driving him to defect to Cao Cao. In the end, Yang Song's treacherous self-serving behavior earned Cao Cao's contempt, and he was executed.","jp":"張魯配下の謀士。金銀財宝に目がなく極めて強欲であった。劉備配下の謀士・孫乾から賄賂を受け取って流言を捏造し、馬超と張魯を仲違いさせて劉備へ奔らせた。曹操が漢中に攻め入った際、龐徳とともに城を守ったが、曹軍からも賄賂を受け取って龐徳を陥れ、曹操に投降させた。最後は主を売って栄達を図った廉で、曹操に蔑まれて処刑された。","kr":"장로 휘하의 모사로, 금은보화를 극도로 탐했다. 유비의 모사 손건에게 뇌물을 받고 유언비어를 퍼뜨려, 마초가 장로와 결별하고 유비에게 귀순하게 만들었다. 조조가 한중으로 진공했을 때 양송은 방덕과 함께 성을 지켰으나, 조조군의 뇌물을 받고 방덕을 모함하여 결국 방덕이 조조에게 투항하게 만들었다. 끝내 주군을 팔아 영달을 꾀하려다 조조의 멸시를 받고 처형당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10303","remark":"","surname":"杨","surnameTc":"楊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"楊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"松","nameTc":"松","nameEn":"Song","nameJp":"松","nameKr":"송","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"杨松","power":"WJ10160","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"186","city":"CS1036","gender":"0","rule":"18","force":"12","wise":"46","politics":"32","charm":"10","will":"21","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"1","weaponMaster":"4/4/4/4/4/29/5/4","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"",